OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786468725
OL,3,CCyber incident sees data from ten
OL,4,CChannel Island charities breached
OL,6,FAt least ten Channel Island charities
OL,7,Fhave reported data breaches after an
OL,8,Fissue with a third-party company,
OL,9,Faccording to regulators.
OL,11,FIt follows a cybersecurity incident at
OL,12,FBeacon CRM, which holds data for these
OL,13,Forganisations.
OL,15,FCopies of names and addresses are
OL,16,Fthought to have been taken, but the
OL,17,Ffirm says there's no evidence card
OL,18,Fdetails have been compromised.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/6
