PN,35602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786468725
OL,3,CCyber incident sees data from ten
OL,4,CChannel Island charities breached
OL,6,FBeacon CRM told its users: "We
OL,7,Fimmediately engaged external cyber-
OL,8,Fsecurity experts to help us
OL,9,Finvestigate and secure our systems.
OL,11,F"Our current understanding is that
OL,12,Fcompromised credentials were used to
OL,13,Fgain access to Beacon, and copies of
OL,14,Four database backups were made."
OL,16,FMacmillan Cancer Support Jersey first
OL,17,Freported a potential data security
OL,18,Fincident on Tuesday 4 August.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786468725
OL,3,CCyber incident sees data from ten
OL,4,CChannel Island charities breached
OL,6,FIn an email, they explained: "Beacon
OL,7,Fhas informed us that it is
OL,8,Finvestigating a cyber security
OL,9,Fincident involving unauthorised access
OL,10,Fto copies of customer database backups.
OL,12,F"While its investigation is ongoing,
OL,13,FBeacon has advised customers to assume
OL,14,Fthat data held within their CRM
OL,15,Fdatabase may have been affected until
OL,16,Ffurther information is available."
OL,18,FThey reassured their users that they
OL,19,Fdo not store payment card information
OL,20,For service user records witnin their
OL,21,FBeacon CRM.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786468725
OL,3,CCyber incident sees data from ten
OL,4,CChannel Island charities breached
OL,6,FHowever, information relating to
OL,7,Fsupporter, donor, volunteer and event
OL,8,Fparticipation records - together with
OL,9,Fcontact details and communication
OL,10,Fpreferences - may have been accessed.
OL,12,FJersey's Information Commissioner says
OL,13,Feight island charities have reported a
OL,14,Fdata breach.
OL,16,FHe said his office is now liaising
OL,17,Fwith colleagues at the UK's
OL,18,FInformation Commissioner's Office
OL,19,F(UKICO).
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786468725
OL,3,CCyber incident sees data from ten
OL,4,CChannel Island charities breached
OL,6,FHe added that as Beacon CRM is a UK-
OL,7,Fbased provider, the breach lies under
OL,8,Fthe UKICO's regulatory remit.
OL,10,FIn a statement, the Guernsey Office of
OL,11,Fthe Data Protection Authority (ODPA)
OL,12,Fsaid they are aware of the breach and
OL,13,Freceived two incident reports from
OL,14,FBailiwick-based charities.
OL,16,F"In terms of data compromised, we
OL,17,Funderstand it to include contact
OL,18,Finformation and financial data, but we
OL,19,Fcontinue to assess the situation,"
OL,20,Fthey explained.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786468725
OL,3,CCyber incident sees data from ten
OL,4,CChannel Island charities breached
OL,6,F"Should a Guernsey charity or
OL,7,Forganisation become aware that they
OL,8,Fhave been compromised by the breach,
OL,9,Fwe would remind them of their
OL,10,Fobligations to report such incidents
OL,11,Fto our Office.
OL,13,F"In addition to assessing the impact
OL,14,Fof such incidents, our Office will
OL,15,Foften provide actionable advice on
OL,16,Fnotification obligations and how to
OL,17,Fmitigate risks stemming from a breach."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/6
